  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Psyc 304.02 Character Qualifications.\n\n(a) An applicant for a telepass licensure as a psychologist shall be approved if the applicant is of good character as defined by Psyc 303.01(b).\n\nSource. #13862, eff 4-2-24",
